  "primaryContentSections" : [
    {
      "content" : [
        {
          "anchor" : "Overview",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Overview",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The Christiera Programme (TCP) is a programme for Ngee Ann Poly’s high performing students, consisting of scholarship",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "holders and the top 5% of students in each course.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "It is named after a flower, and has no religious connections or function despite its name.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "small"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "As a member of the Events subcommittee, I helped to plan the TCP Bonding Day and TCP Flagship.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "TCP-Bonding-Day",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "TCP Bonding Day",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "TCP Bonding Day is an event near the start of Semester 2 of each academic year, and is targeted",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "towards new TCP members.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "It was our first event as the TCP Events Subcomm, and we were placed in a video call to get the",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "event done. I took lead along with some other (more outgoing than me) members, and we planned",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "several games that teams would play in a round-robin format. One of the games was a “laser maze”,",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "where we strung red tape between chairs and tables and had TCP members navigate through while",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "holding hands.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "TCP-Flagship",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "TCP Flagship",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "TCP Flagship is an event done in collaboration with Dialogue in the Dark and the Singapore",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "Association for the Visually Impaired. We would run activities for the visually impaired clients,",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "allowing NP student volunteers the experience of working with people with a significantly different",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "world outlook than themselves.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "I was assigned In Charge of Activity 1, which was a sachet making activity. I had to coordinate",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "a small team of Events subcomm members to plan out the materials to use and buy, along with run",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "the event on the day itself.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "kind" : "content"
    }
  ],
